#### This PR:
- Removes `guildRegion` method, since Discord no longer uses it for guild regions;
- Optimizes the methods `guildFeatures`, `prettify` and `resolveUserHandle`, since both were using "mass" switch/case;
- Creates `GuildFeatures` enum to facilitate the `guildFeatures` method.

Added "weapon types" definitions:

-A combination of Animation type, Grip type, Reload animation and Attack animation;
-Can be associated with any animations folder;
-Can then be used to replace all animations for weapons of the same "type" in a plugin or globally;
-Additionally, added mod & folder combination for .json, same as naming a folder after a plugin.
-Additionally, added proper iteration through all the forms (credits to Yvileapsis).

For rebase CC/containerd to upstream latest.

See #3642 for details.

@stevenhorsman Can you help me review? Thanks for your previous work.

The methode .HSSID() is only working for datapoints, not for channels and not for devices. While e.g. 
var x = channel.HSSID();
causes an runtime error, is 
if( "CLIMATECONTROL_RT_TRANSCEIVER" == channel.HssType() )
simply evaluated always to TRUE. In the old version the inner block is evaluateted for every channel in the CCU!
